<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Shlok Sethia — Senior ML Engineer</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg:        #090c10;
      --bg-card:   #0e1318;
      --bg-hover:  #131a22;
      --border:    rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      --ink:       #e8eaf0;
      --muted:     #6b7685;
      --accent:    #00e5c0;
      --accent2:   #5b8fff;
      --gold:      #f5c542;
      --red:       #ff5c6a;
      --radius:    12px;
      --mono:      'DM Mono', monospace;
      --serif:     'DM Serif Display', serif;
      --sans:      'Syne', sans-serif;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.035'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    .blob { position: fixed; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; opacity: 0.18; }
    .blob-1 { width: 600px; height: 600px; top: -200px; left: -200px; background: var(--accent2); }
    .blob-2 { width: 500px; height: 500px; bottom: -150px; right: -150px; background: var(--accent); }
    .blob-3 { width: 300px; height: 300px; top: 40%; left: 55%; background: var(--gold); opacity: 0.08; }

    /* ── Nav ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.1rem 2.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(9,12,16,0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }
    .nav-logo { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    #about {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4rem;
      padding: 8rem 6rem 5rem;
    }

    .hero-text { max-width: 560px; }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.1s forwards;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow::before { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--accent); }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5rem);
      line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.25s forwards;
    }
    h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }

    .hero-bio { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 440px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s forwards; }

    .hero-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.55s forwards; }
    .tag { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--accent2); background: rgba(91,143,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(91,143,255,0.2); padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 99px; }

    .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.7s forwards; }

    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1.6rem; border-radius: var(--radius); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.25s; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #090c10; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #00ffd5; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,229,192,0.3); }
    .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); background: var(--bg-hover); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .hero-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.6s forwards; }

    .stat-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
    .stat-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .stat-card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; }
    .stat-card.c1::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent); }
    .stat-card.c2::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent2), transparent); }
    .stat-card.c3::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), transparent); }
    .stat-card.c4::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), transparent); }
    .stat-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 2.8rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .stat-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ── Sections ── */
    section { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 6rem 6rem; }
    section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

    .section-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .section-label::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border); max-width: 60px; }

    h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .section-intro { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }

    /* ── Experience ── */
    .exp-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }

    .exp-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem 2.25rem;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
    }
    .exp-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
    .exp-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px; }
    .exp-card.walmart::before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2)); }
    .exp-card.samsung::before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold), var(--red)); }

    .exp-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .exp-company { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .exp-role { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
    .exp-meta { text-align: right; }
    .exp-location { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .exp-date { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--accent2); letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

    .exp-bullets { list-style: none; margin-top: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .exp-bullets li { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); padding-left: 1.2rem; position: relative; line-height: 1.6; }
    .exp-bullets li::before { content: '→'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem; top: 0.1rem; }
    .exp-bullets li strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

    .exp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
    .chip { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); }

    /* ── Projects ── */
    .projects-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }

    .project-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .project-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }

    .project-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .icon-teal { background: rgba(0,229,192,0.12); }
    .icon-blue { background: rgba(91,143,255,0.12); }
    .icon-gold { background: rgba(245,197,66,0.12); }
    .icon-red  { background: rgba(255,92,106,0.12); }

    .project-title { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
    .project-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); flex: 1; }
    .project-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .project-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.05em; transition: gap 0.2s; margin-top: auto; }
    .project-link:hover { gap: 0.7rem; }
    .project-link svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }

    /* ── Education ── */
    .edu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }

    .edu-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
    .edu-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .edu-card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; }
    .edu-card.col::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent2), transparent); }
    .edu-card.rv::after  { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), transparent); }

    .edu-school { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent2); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .edu-degree { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .edu-gpa { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .edu-meta { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .edu-meta strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── Speaking / Publications ── */
    .speaking-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }

    .speak-col-title { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 0.75rem; }

    .item-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }

    .item { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0 1rem; align-items: start; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
    .item:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.13); transform: translateX(4px); }

    .item-badge { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding-top: 0.2rem; background: rgba(0,229,192,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,192,0.2); padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; white-space: nowrap; height: fit-content; }
    .item-venue { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--accent2); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .item-title { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .item-sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ── Contact ── */
    #contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; }
    .contact-text h2 { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .contact-text p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 380px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }

    .contact-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.25rem; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.25s; }
    .contact-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }

    .contact-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .ci-linkedin { background: rgba(10,102,194,0.2); }
    .ci-github   { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
    .ci-email    { background: rgba(0,229,192,0.1); }
    .ci-phone    { background: rgba(245,197,66,0.1); }
    .contact-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }

    .contact-card-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
    .contact-card-value { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }

    .availability { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--accent); background: rgba(0,229,192,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,192,0.2); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 99px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .availability::before { content: ''; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }

    /* Skills section */
    .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
    .skill-cat { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.75rem; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
    .skill-cat:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .skill-cat-title { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .skill-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .skill-tag { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 6px; }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    footer { position: relative; z-index: 1; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2rem 6rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    footer p { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }

    /* ── Animations ── */
    @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0,229,192,0.4); } 50% { opacity: 0.7; box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(0,229,192,0); } }

    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    /* ── Responsive ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { gap: 1.2rem; }
      #about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 7rem 2rem 4rem; gap: 3rem; }
      .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
      .speaking-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .edu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      #contact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; padding: 4rem 2rem; }
      footer { padding: 1.5rem 2rem; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .stat-num { font-size: 2rem; }
      .projects-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .exp-header { flex-direction: column; }
      .exp-meta { text-align: left; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-2"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-3"></div>

  <!-- Nav -->
  <nav>
    <span class="nav-logo">SS / ML</span>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
      <li><a href="#publications">Publications</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Senior ML Engineer · Ads &amp; Marketing</div>
      <h1>Building systems that<br><em>scale &amp; convert</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-bio">
        Senior ML Engineer at Walmart Global Tech with a Master's from Columbia (3.97 GPA).
        Architect of bidding systems, NLP models, and recommendation engines driving
        $300M+ in revenue — and a Kaggle Competition Expert ranked in the top 2% worldwide.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-tags">
        <span class="tag">NLP</span>
        <span class="tag">Bidding Systems</span>
        <span class="tag">Two-Tower Models</span>
        <span class="tag">MLOps</span>
        <span class="tag">A/B Testing</span>
        <span class="tag">PyTorch</span>
        <span class="tag">Causal Inference</span>
        <span class="tag">Kaggle Expert</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
        <a href="#experience" class="btn btn-ghost">View Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat-card c1">
        <div class="stat-num">$300M+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Revenue Generated</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card c2">
        <div class="stat-num">40×</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Platform Scale</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card c3">
        <div class="stat-num">Top 2%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Kaggle Worldwide</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card c4">
        <div class="stat-num">3.97</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Columbia GPA</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Experience -->
  <section id="experience">
    <div class="section-label">Career</div>
    <h2>Work Experience</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Production ML systems at scale — from vendor-funded auction engines to NLP-powered cold-start models.
    </p>

    <div class="exp-list reveal">

      <div class="exp-card walmart">
        <div class="exp-header">
          <div>
            <div class="exp-company">Walmart Global Tech</div>
            <div class="exp-role">Senior Machine Learning Engineer — Ads &amp; Marketing</div>
          </div>
          <div class="exp-meta">
            <div class="exp-location">Sunnyvale, USA</div>
            <div class="exp-date">Jul 2022 – Present</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="exp-bullets">
          <li><strong>Affiliates Item Recommendation:</strong> Led development of a Two-Tower NLP item recommendation model for Walmart's $11.3B affiliate market, combining item name embeddings with multi-channel traffic data and competitor metrics to drive higher sales and affiliate partner commissions.</li>
          <li><strong>Coldstart BERT Model:</strong> Built an NLP model using metadata to predict conversion rates and RPC for "cold" items in paid channels — driving a <strong>30% traffic increase</strong> and <strong>22% catalog expansion</strong> while maintaining ROAS.</li>
          <li><strong>Top Spender Bidder:</strong> Owned the full lifecycle of a PLA bidding system — design, modeling, A/B testing, deployment, and maintenance — leveraging near-real-time data to optimize ad ranking, control spend, and improve ROAS.</li>
          <li><strong>Vendor-Funded Marketing Platform:</strong> One of the first ML engineers on the platform; built core bidding/auction algorithms, pacing scripts, and budget forecasting systems — scaling it <strong>40× and driving $300M+ in revenue</strong>.</li>
        </ul>
